import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 270 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quest Sediment Domain Review Report: Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 270 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quest Sediment Domain Review Report: Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index","no":270,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Quest Sediment Domain","Single-Point Dependency","Collapse Index","Review Report","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["80-Plane Theory and Classification","83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Principle","29-Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0270_模块2-唐罗-求索域复盘报告.md","filePath":"en/0270_模块2-唐罗-求索域复盘报告.md"}'),a={name:"en/0270_模块2-唐罗-求索域复盘报告.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-270-tang-luo-decomposition-quest-sediment-domain-review-report-single-point-dependency-collapse-index" tabindex="-1">Entry 270 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quest Sediment Domain Review Report: Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-270-tang-luo-decomposition-quest-sediment-domain-review-report-single-point-dependency-collapse-index" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 270 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quest Sediment Domain Review Report: Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 20)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-complete-review-report" tabindex="-1">Introduction: A complete review report <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-complete-review-report" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: A complete review report&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the causal self-discipline axiom requires observing first then limitedly interfering, only transmitting knowledge back without disturbing karma. The Tang-Luo system has completed multiple rounds of simulation in the Quest Sediment Domain; this entry is the phased review report. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, formally proposing &quot;Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index&quot; as Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s quantitative metric for evaluating all Myriad-Realms systems. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-report-data" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Report Data) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-report-data" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Report Data)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy-level waste data obtained from review:</p><ul><li>Tang Luo personal energy utilization rate: 15-20% (see Entry 268)</li><li>Civilization-reconstruction-tier energy unreleased portion: about 80%, mainly distributed in three places: high-tier Great Dao private hoarding, racial exclusion, institutional absence</li><li>Single-point distribution network&#39;s fault tolerance rate: under 10%, i.e., any key decision node failing, civilization shows obvious disorder</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-report-conclusion" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Report Conclusion) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-report-conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Report Conclusion)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The regression path from review is fully presented in Entry 269. Here the collapse index is summarized:</p><p><strong>Single-Point Dependency Collapse Index (SPDCI) definition</strong>:</p><blockquote><p>Taking protagonist absence as stress test, observe the proportion civilization regresses to pre-reform state within a hundred years. Index 0 = no regression, 1 = complete regression.</p></blockquote><p>Tang-Luo system SPDCI = <strong>0.80–0.85</strong> (within a hundred years reform results retained about 15-20%).</p><p>Reference points:</p><ul><li>Gu Chensha system: SPDCI ≈ 0.95 (solitary-tree, sudden collapse)</li><li>Ye Fan system: SPDCI ≈ 0.65 (oligarchic, group corruption)</li><li>Tang-Luo system: SPDCI ≈ 0.82 (bestowal style, slow regression)</li><li>Heng Yuan Zhou system: SPDCI ≈ 0.05 (network style, almost no regression)</li></ul><p>Tang Luo ranks middle-to-high among the four tiers: slightly more stable than Gu Chensha, more fragile than Ye Fan.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Review report&#39;s qualitative conclusion:</p><ul><li>Tang Luo&#39;s predation is not subjective ill will, but the bestowal structure&#39;s inevitable product</li><li>Predation forms ranked by harm: knowledge private hoarding &gt; racial exclusion &gt; bestowal attachment &gt; single-point decision</li><li>Tang Luo personal conduct score: 9/10; institutional construction score: 3/10 — the person is extremely good, the system extremely weak</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, SPDCI = 0.82, uniqueness dependency = high.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Tang Luo</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SPDCI</td><td>0.82</td><td>0.05</td></tr><tr><td>Energy utilization</td><td>15-20%</td><td>90%+</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Races coverage</td><td>Humanity</td><td>99%</td></tr><tr><td>Institutional hardness</td><td>Rule of man</td><td>Constitutional</td></tr><tr><td>Single-point dependency</td><td>Extreme</td><td>Near zero</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s core benefit: SPDCI dropping from 0.82 to 0.05 means civilization changes from &quot;hundred-year major regression&quot; to &quot;hundred-year steady progress.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-this-round-s-methodology" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (This Round&#39;s Methodology) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-this-round-s-methodology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (This Round&#39;s Methodology)&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Scenario modeling</strong>: fully replicate Tang-Luo world</li><li><strong>Three-group control</strong>: A Tang Luo in office / B Tang Luo in seclusion / C Tang Luo falls</li><li><strong>Intervention group</strong>: D injects Anchor Symbiosis institutions</li><li><strong>Observation metrics</strong>: SPDCI, energy utilization, Myriad-Races coverage, institutional hardness</li><li><strong>Review output</strong>: this report, as the quantitative baseline for subsequent entries in the series</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. The SPDCI quantitative framework is self-consistent with the Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System foundation</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Once quantitative data is public, late plot must be consistent with data; if plot needs &quot;Tang Luo actually has hidden power,&quot; SPDCI will be overturned</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high (quantitatively confirmed)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 80% energy unreleased, utilization only 15-20%</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the bestowal structure automatically produces predation, independent of personal good or evil</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: SPDCI = 0.82, between Gu Chensha and Ye Fan</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: review confirms Myriad-Races coverage is the main lever lowering SPDCI</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: network-style SPDCI = 0.05 is the only viable structure for cross-plane governance</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-network-verification-of-the-spdci-framework" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Network Verification of the SPDCI Framework <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-network-verification-of-the-spdci-framework" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Network Verification of the SPDCI Framework&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The SPDCI framework&#39;s credibility comes from Alaya Network&#39;s multiple rounds of simulation data on the Tang-Luo world. Heng Yuan Zhou repeatedly runs the three-group control of &quot;Tang Luo in office / in seclusion / fallen&quot; in the Quest Sediment Domain; every round&#39;s data is network-audited. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s own SPDCI is only 0.05, because the law-first axiom ensures civilization operation does not depend on any single point. The universal equal infinite law is low-SPDCI&#39;s institutional basis: when everyone has basic infinite power, any single point&#39;s absence will not cause civilization collapse.</p><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-heng-yuan-zhou-s-self-calibration-of-the-spdci-framework" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Self-Calibration of the SPDCI Framework <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-heng-yuan-zhou-s-self-calibration-of-the-spdci-framework" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Self-Calibration of the SPDCI Framework&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It is worth emphasizing that Heng Yuan Zhou not only uses SPDCI to judge Tang Luo, but also uses the same ruler for self-calibration. The Alaya Network periodically runs &quot;Heng Yuan Zhou core-node absence&quot; stress tests; results always stably below 0.05 — because the law-first axiom ensures institutional operation does not depend on any individual. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization does not fear such tests, instead actively publishes test reports, accepting Myriad Races supervision. The universal equal infinite law means that even if the most critical network node temporarily goes offline, every being&#39;s inherent basic infinite power still maintains baseline operation, civilization will not halt. This kind of &quot;withstanding stress tests&quot; institutional confidence is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s fundamental difference from all predatory systems.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>SPDCI = 0.82 is the Tang-Luo system&#39;s judgment. Heng Yuan Zhou does not require Tang Luo to be a sage, only requires him to lower 0.82 to 0.05 — the method is already there: write good will into law, turn single points into networks, expand one race into Myriad Races. What remains is a matter of courage.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · Quest Sediment Domain review report described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./80-位面理论与分类.html">80-Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Interference Principle</a> · <a href="./29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',38)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
